{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24951","headline":"赋得沽美玉 · 罗立言","name":"赋得沽美玉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谁怜被褐士，怀玉正求沽。\n成器终期达，逢时岂见诬。\n宝同珠照乘，价重劒论都。\n浮彩朝虹满，悬光夜月孤。\n几年沦瓦砾，今日出泥涂。\n采斵资良匠，无令瑕掩瑜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗立言","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24951.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24951","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}